### Naija JUG tracing demo: every request goes through the gateway (:8080)
# Every request carries W3C baggage customer.tier=gold: it shows up on spans and log lines in every
# service, and gold traces are always kept by the Collector's tail sampling.
@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@baggage = customer.tier=gold

### 1. What's on the menu?
GET {{gateway}}/api/inventory
baggage: {{baggage}}

### 2. Happy path: order jollof (gateway -> order -> inventory x2 -> Postgres -> Kafka -> notification)
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
baggage: {{baggage}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "JOLLOF-001", "quantity": 2, "customerEmail": "ada@naijajug.ng" }

### 3. Out of stock: only 5 zobo in stock -> order saved as REJECTED, event still published
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
baggage: {{baggage}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "ZOBO-001", "quantity": 50, "customerEmail": "ada@naijajug.ng" }

### 4. Unknown SKU -> 404 from inventory, surfaced by order-service
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
baggage: {{baggage}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "SHAWARMA-001", "quantity": 1, "customerEmail": "ada@naijajug.ng" }

### 5. Fetch orders
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders
baggage: {{baggage}}

### 6. Chaos: make inventory slow (applies to every inventory call, and an order makes two)
POST {{gateway}}/api/inventory/chaos
baggage: {{baggage}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latencyMs": 1500, "failureRate": 0.0 }

### 7. Chaos: make inventory fail half the time -> order-service answers 502
POST {{gateway}}/api/inventory/chaos
baggage: {{baggage}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latencyMs": 0, "failureRate": 0.5 }

### 8. Order under chaos (run a few times)
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
baggage: {{baggage}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "SUYA-001", "quantity": 1, "customerEmail": "ada@naijajug.ng" }

### 9. Calm down: reset chaos
POST {{gateway}}/api/inventory/chaos
baggage: {{baggage}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latencyMs": 0, "failureRate": 0.0 }
